
    <!-- HERO -->
    <section class="page-hero tall">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="breadcrumb">
          <a href="/">Home</a>
          <span class="mi" aria-hidden="true">chevron_right</span>
          <a href="/blogs/journal">Guides</a>
          <span class="mi" aria-hidden="true">chevron_right</span>
          <span>Buying Guides</span>
        </div>
        <span class="ph-eyebrow">Perfume Buying Guides</span>
        <h1 class="ph-title">Buy Your Next Scent With <em>Confidence</em></h1>
        <p class="ph-sub">Choosing perfume should feel exciting, not overwhelming. These guides walk you through everything — reading fragrance notes, matching a scent to the occasion, and knowing what to expect before you spend a single dirham.</p>
        <div class="ph-meta">
          <span><span class="mi" aria-hidden="true">verified_user</span>100% authentic sourcing</span>
          <span><span class="mi" aria-hidden="true">local_shipping</span>Free UAE delivery over AED {{ settings.free_shipping_threshold | default: '250' }}</span>
          <span><span class="mi" aria-hidden="true">autorenew</span>{{ settings.returns_window_days | default: '2' }}-day returns on faults</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- QUICK-LINK TEASERS -->
    <section class="section">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="sec-head center fade-up">
          <span class="label">Start Here</span>
          <h2 class="sec-title">Guides Worth <em>Bookmarking</em></h2>
          <p class="sec-sub">Three essential reads that turn fragrance shopping from guesswork into a genuine pleasure.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="topic-grid fade-up">
          <a class="topic-card" href="/pages/scent-education">
            <span class="mi" aria-hidden="true">school</span>
            <h3>The Beginner's Guide</h3>
            <p>New to perfume? Learn the language of scent families, concentrations and the fragrance pyramid before you buy.</p>
            <span class="btn-ghost topic-go">Explore <span class="mi" aria-hidden="true">arrow_forward</span></span>
          </a>
          <a class="topic-card" href="#how-pick">
            <span class="mi" aria-hidden="true">tune</span>
            <h3>How to Choose a Scent</h3>
            <p>A simple four-step method for matching a fragrance to your personality, your occasion and the Gulf climate.</p>
            <span class="btn-ghost topic-go">Explore <span class="mi" aria-hidden="true">arrow_forward</span></span>
          </a>
          <a class="topic-card" href="/pages/scent-education">
            <span class="mi" aria-hidden="true">layers</span>
            <h3>Layering Tips</h3>
            <p>Combine oils and sprays to build a signature that is entirely your own — and lasts noticeably longer.</p>
            <span class="btn-ghost topic-go">Explore <span class="mi" aria-hidden="true">arrow_forward</span></span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- HOW TO PICK STEPS -->
    <section class="section alt" id="how-pick">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="sec-head center fade-up">
          <span class="label">The Method</span>
          <h2 class="sec-title">How to Pick Your <em>Perfect Perfume</em></h2>
          <p class="sec-sub">Follow these four steps in order and you will narrow 218+ brands down to a shortlist that genuinely suits you.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="how-grid fade-up">
          <div class="how-step">
            <span class="mi" aria-hidden="true">science</span>
            <h3>Read the Notes</h3>
            <p>Start with the scent family. Fresh and citrus, floral, sweet and gourmand, spicy oriental or deep oud — identify what you are naturally drawn to.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="how-step">
            <span class="mi" aria-hidden="true">event</span>
            <h3>Match the Occasion</h3>
            <p>A daytime office scent and an evening statement fragrance behave very differently. Decide where you will wear it most before you commit.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="how-step">
            <span class="mi" aria-hidden="true">schedule</span>
            <h3>Check the Longevity</h3>
            <p>Concentration drives staying power. EDPs and attars project for hours; lighter EDTs are softer and closer to the skin. Choose to suit the moment.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="how-step">
            <span class="mi" aria-hidden="true">wb_sunny</span>
            <h3>Consider the Season</h3>
            <p>Warm, resinous notes shine in cooler evenings, while crisp citrus and aquatics survive the UAE summer heat. Let the climate guide you.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- FEATURED GUIDE -->
    <section class="section">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="feature-article fade-up">
          <div class="fa-media"><img src="{{ 'prod-bouquet-oud.png' | asset_url }}" alt="Perfume bottle with soft golden reflection" /></div>
          <div class="fa-body">
            <span class="bl-cat">Essential Reading</span>
            <h2>Understanding Fragrance Notes: Top, Heart &amp; Base</h2>
            <p>Every perfume tells its story in three acts. Top notes are the bright first impression that greets you at the first spray; heart notes are the character that emerges as it settles; base notes are the lasting trail that lingers for hours. Learn to read all three and you will never buy blind again.</p>
            <p>Once you can name what you are smelling, comparing bottles becomes effortless — and finding your signature becomes a pleasure rather than a gamble.</p>
            <a class="btn-ghost" href="/pages/scent-education">Read the full breakdown <span class="mi" aria-hidden="true">arrow_forward</span></a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- TESTIMONIALS -->
    {%- comment -%}
      Real reviews, or no reviews section at all. Judge.me holds this store's
      actual reviews; what used to fill this block was six invented customers
      written into app.js. With none synced the whole section — heading
      included — is absent, rather than a promise of testimonials over a gap.
    {%- endcomment -%}
    {%- assign tfs_shop_reviews = shop.metafields.judgeme.shop_reviews_count | plus: 0 -%}
    {%- if tfs_shop_reviews > 0 -%}
    <section class="section alt">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="sec-head center fade-up">
          <span class="label">Trusted by Fragrance Lovers</span>
          <h2 class="sec-title">Shoppers Who Found <em>Their Match</em></h2>
          <p class="sec-sub">Real reviews from customers across the Emirates who used our guidance to choose with confidence.</p>
        </div>
        {% render 'shop-reviews', show: 'carousel' %}
      </div>
    </section>
    {%- endif -%}

    <!-- FULL GUIDE ARTICLES -->
    <section class="section">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="sec-head center fade-up">
          <span class="label">More Guides</span>
          <h2 class="sec-title">Every Buying <em>Guide</em></h2>
          <p class="sec-sub">Comparisons, how-tos and expert advice to help you shop smarter.</p>
        </div>
        {%- if blogs['journal'].articles.size > 0 -%}<div class="blog-grid fade-up">{%- for article in blogs['journal'].articles limit: 6 -%}<a class="bl-card" href="{{ article.url }}"><div class="bl-img-wrap">{% if article.image %}<img class="bl-img" src="{{ article.image | image_url: width: 700 }}" alt="{{ article.title | escape }}" loading="lazy">{% endif %}</div>{% if article.tags.size > 0 %}<div class="bl-cat">{{ article.tags.first }}</div>{% endif %}<div class="bl-title">{{ article.title }}</div><div class="bl-excerpt">{{ article.excerpt_or_content | strip_html | truncatewords: 24 }}</div><div class="bl-meta">{{ article.published_at | date: '%B %-d, %Y' }}</div></a>{%- endfor -%}</div>{%- else -%}<div class="blog-grid fade-up" data-render="blogs"></div>{%- endif -%}
      </div>
    </section>

{% schema %}
{ "name": "Buying guides page", "settings": [] }
{% endschema %}
